e":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","review_id":"h7x9_cbXQaUAsHUMH6yw6Q","date":"2021-04-25T12:00:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929729700088501,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I ate here and loved it. The hummus and baba ganoush were tasty, and the beef shawarma was my favorite -- my wife loved the chicken shawarma because of the garlicy sauce. The shawarmas are also toasted, which is great. They offer Lebanese wine (we will try next time), and they have a few beers on top -- mostly local."},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","review_id":"OO3PfX_OGClwcooT0yuo1w","date":"2021-07-11T13:32:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9172248244285583,"text_excerpt":"HUGE portions of really delicious food! Hummus was amazing and the pita that they served with it was thick and hot. The chicken shawarma plate came with so much chicken that was crispy and perfectly seasoned. I would probably get the sandwich next time because it was an insane amount of food. You can definitely share here! Inside aesthetic is a little chaotic lol but it's cool you can sit outside and they keep the large door windows facing the French Quarter open for people watching. Only complaint was that the music was sooo loud. Other than that, great dinner!"},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","review_id":"ZXiLLwkPdHePwu7qS0faZw","date":"2021-06-03T20:45:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9032890796661377,"text_excerpt":"Most legit Lebanese food in NOLA other than the original Lebanon uptown. We went with a group of friends and I ordered the gyro sandwich with babaganush which was excellent. A friend ordered the gyro plate which was huge and full of some of the best gyro in town. Others ordered the chicken shawarma which was the best in town, juicy chunks of well seasoned chicken. Only two drawbacks, the salad dressing was just olive oil and the Lebanese tea was just tea and rose water with no pine nuts and it wasn't very sweet my friends who ordered rice said it was pretty tasteless. Everything else including the service was excellent."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","photo_id":"y_JoDPk465mf0pc2cahrdA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/y_JoDPk465mf0pc2cahrdA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9327894449234009},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","photo_id":"1mf2cdmY42UfLRzxUrTpQg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1mf2cdmY42UfLRzxUrTpQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8560853004455566},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","photo_id":"p3j2sAZrNjKUQdREdj7RPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/p3j2sAZrNjKUQdREdj7RPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8150699138641357},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","photo_id":"TMsebskNYkpw-Q3b2S4gqQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TMsebskNYkpw-Q3b2S4gqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7938074469566345},{"business_id":"K0Iu41wf32UBaow2g8iiaQ","photo_id":"YG4dwElCKesMKBX10VmBfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YG4dwElCKesMKBX10VmBfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.